<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Email verified · StockChief</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/commercial.css?v=auth"></head><body class="commercial-auth"><main class="auth-centered"><a class="pub-brand" href="/"><span class="pub-brand__mark">◇</span><span>StockChief</span></a><div class="auth-centered__card"><span class="auth-mail auth-mail--ok">✓</span><h1>Email verified.</h1><p>Next, activate the <strong><%= selection.planId %></strong> plan. Stripe handles payment details; StockChief never receives your card number.</p><form method="post" action="/billing/checkout" data-loading><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="planId" value="<%= selection.planId %>"><input type="hidden" name="interval" value="<%= selection.interval %>"><input type="hidden" name="promoCode" value="<%= selection.promoCode||'' %>"><button class="pub-btn pub-btn--block" type="submit" data-loading-label="Opening secure checkout…">Continue to secure checkout</button></form><p class="auth-foot"><a href="/pricing">Review plans first</a></p></div></main><script src="/commercial.js?v=auth" defer></script></body></html>
